{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_7000_place", "source_sha256": "d4791fb11477fe30ba4df1a8faada2b28b2b8855f65e1a06166ed650c671fc94", "ja": "公園", "zh": "公园", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_7001_p", "source_sha256": "58653a1b742922f40d640f6262e591f6edaa06bfa85841a9a8e5e63899abf025", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影日。\nスライムの衣装を着た麗花はいつもより楽しそうだ）", "zh": "（今天是写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的拍摄日。\n穿着史莱姆服装的丽花看起来比平时更开心。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_7002_048rei", "source_sha256": "ab0b820bed30b31daec5f8119f7519ea3b85cb61f8a92b656ba721d884dc9d80", "ja": "じゃじゃーん！　ゼリーでもクラゲでもありません。\nすべすべぷにぷにのスライムちゃんで～す♪", "zh": "锵锵！不是果冻，也不是水母。\n是滑溜溜、软乎乎的史莱姆哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_7003_p", "source_sha256": "b343f79e705e738a955d15ebd362352122fbf612ca02d4b1584d1c4d75b5e4c9", "ja": "はは。ご機嫌みたいだな、麗花。\n衣装も気に入ってくれたみたいでなによりだよ。", "zh": "哈哈，心情不错嘛，丽花。看来你也很喜欢这套服装，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_7004_048rei", "source_sha256": "1285087fb33cb8c3d277af2e9415fc195249c0822d0a88c1af4b5e16e0344a07", "ja": "はい♪　でも、何かが足りないような……？\nぷるぷる～とか、どろどろ～が不足してるのかも。", "zh": "嗯♪ 不过，总觉得好像还缺了点什么……？\n或许是少了些“颤颤悠悠～”或者“黏糊糊～”之类的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_7005_048rei", "source_sha256": "16aecd7663cff722c602583875f698cab6d3436d5fa0f17c1a4ccabbea6ea822", "ja": "ということで、{$P$}さん。\nとっても普通で、ナイスなアドバイスをお願いします。", "zh": "所以说，就是{$P$}先生。\n请给我非常普通又很棒的建议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_7006_p", "source_sha256": "e4adcdcfe4376a238ef7adf3ddc19d7c7ce8a1bc8db271d9c5bb23cf77ea870a", "ja": "ず、随分急だな……。\nでも『ぷるぷる』と『どろどろ』か。そうだな……。", "zh": "这、这也太突然了吧……\n不过“弹弹”和“黏糊糊”吗。让我想想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_7007", "source_sha256": "ab4d5d84eafc22a6e74b8a8c6134b06c706453b4d20fbf73367280e9b28e6e8c", "ja": "ぷるぷるかな？", "zh": "是不是在发抖？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_7008", "source_sha256": "159a4013199969291bf94e13e30dc7f064d55ab11a6ffbc994d6d21fe4af4fd5", "ja": "どろどろだ！", "zh": "泥泞不堪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_7200_p", "source_sha256": "c12cddb521ae4816c7c1dc5978b2a52c4b3da837c6d90d7cb066e9c847e5ac4c", "ja": "スライムがテーマだし、ぷるぷるな感じを\n表現できれば、よりかわいらしく見えるかもな。", "zh": "既然主题是史莱姆，要是能表现出\nQ弹的感觉，或许会显得更可爱吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_7201_048rei", "source_sha256": "38b7a9ae71bdea651d6eb568fde87153a3e53fd6528307d2c9799e801ecfc9e4", "ja": "ふむふむ、なるほど！　プリンみたいに\nぷるぷるなスライムちゃんになればいいんですね。", "zh": "嗯嗯，原来如此！也就是说，要变成像布丁一样Q弹的史莱姆，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_7202_048rei", "source_sha256": "0ef1a23458263efc9d2437cbe59c2de1ffea26fd912b79b08cba98252e21eefc", "ja": "ザ・普通のアドバイス、ありがとうございます。\nぷるぷる感が増すアイテムを探してきまーす♪", "zh": "谢谢你这普通得不能再普通的建议。\n我去找能增加Q弹感的道具啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_7300_p", "source_sha256": "c12cddb521ae4816c7c1dc5978b2a52c4b3da837c6d90d7cb066e9c847e5ac4c", "ja": "スライムがテーマだし、ぷるぷるな感じを\n表現できれば、よりかわいらしく見えるかもな。", "zh": "既然主题是史莱姆，要是能表现出\nQ弹的感觉，或许会显得更可爱吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_7301_048rei", "source_sha256": "e566914b357b606f76775f848876402af4485ae9eba987988fdf08c89d6b8f8f", "ja": "ぷるぷるですね！　それなら……\nいつもよりたくさんスキップしちゃいますね♪", "zh": "摇摇晃晃的呢！那样的话……\n我就比平时多蹦蹦跳跳几下吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_7302_048rei", "source_sha256": "1a0a0d6ea4bd91838c5ab14f3d157fcae9bab9fbdf9a68fc8b2382b05bcb5ce2", "ja": "ではでは、{$P$}さん。\nスキップの撮影、いってきまーす。るんるんるーん♪", "zh": "那么，{$P$}先生。\n我去拍摄跳跃镜头啦。啦啦啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_7500_p", "source_sha256": "8ff03477d623f48934fc36f2604482dd0e208b2cded5cbc70587440354a25a74", "ja": "足すならどろどろがいいんじゃないか？\nリアリティのあるスライムが表現できるかも。", "zh": "要加的话，黏糊糊的不是挺好吗？\n说不定能表现出有真实感的一团烂泥呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_7501_048rei", "source_sha256": "05fe93c63df6c16d6d33db30cdb58583a7c4705eea484a6a6214b1b7983f3e5a", "ja": "アイスクリームみたいなイメージですね！\n私も定期的に溶けてるから、ばっちりですね！", "zh": "是像冰淇淋一样的感觉呢！\n我也会定期融化，所以非常合适！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_7502_048rei", "source_sha256": "7750505a4965a5970f94994ff11892145fc832af2d044dc3c0bcf0e07d5e20df", "ja": "全身の力を抜いて……どろどろ～どろろ～。\nはい、あっという間にスライムちゃんの完成です♪", "zh": "放松全身的力气……变得黏糊糊～黏糊糊～。\n好，这么一转眼，史莱姆就完成啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_7600_p", "source_sha256": "8ff03477d623f48934fc36f2604482dd0e208b2cded5cbc70587440354a25a74", "ja": "足すならどろどろがいいんじゃないか？\nリアリティのあるスライムが表現できるかも。", "zh": "要加的话，黏糊糊的不是挺好吗？\n说不定能表现出有真实感的一团烂泥呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_7601_048rei", "source_sha256": "74b04389069be78610f031d8f5965b1bf66b03021df5e839cb8e9f0bb5961bff", "ja": "うんうん。リアリティがあった方が可愛いですよね。\nでも、どうやったらどろどろに見えるのかな～？", "zh": "嗯嗯。有点真实感会更可爱吧。\n不过，要怎么做才能看起来黏糊糊的呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_7602_048rei", "source_sha256": "aa72db2ebc910c4078adcad6a2b50e49dc881d86ff5dcc43257f61606a70be3c", "ja": "うーん……やっぱり、ふにゃふにゃでもいいですか？\nそっちの方が、私自信あるんです♪", "zh": "嗯……果然还是软乎乎的也可以吗？\n那样的话，我更有自信呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
